Subject: [S] success: transfer of .Data directories
Message-ID: <v04210105b443c82bf6d1@[209.239.169.114]>

Thanks to all of those list members who provided me with prompt and 
helpful information to my question on

transferring data directories from SPlus 3.1 to SPlus 5 on a 
different machine. Data.dump and data.restore are the

key to this process. To summarize for whoever else might have 
interest in this, the process that worked:

1) From SPlus 3.1, data.dump(ls(),"data.files")
2) FTP "data.files" to new machine
3) setup new S working directory with SPlus5 CHAPTER
4) using SPlus5, data.restore("data.files")

Some of the directories were fairly extensive so a few subsets of 
objects were selected to keep file sizes reasonable.  All in all it 
wasn't that cumbersome of an effort.

Thanks again for the assistance,

