From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian D Ripley)
Date: Tue, 02 Nov 1999 19:22:41 +0000
Subject: Re: [S] Testing between GAMs
In-Reply-To: <381F3F7F.418DCC91@uconnvm.uconn.edu>
