From: ripley at stats.ox.ac.uk (Prof Brian D Ripley)
Date: Thu, 11 Nov 1999 07:25:13 +0000
Subject: Re: [S] Leaps and bound functions
In-Reply-To: <01BF2C1E.23F716A0.rahmank@frim.gov.my>
