Subject: Re: Missing symbols in C code loaded in Windows (was [S] Query about fopen?)
Message-ID: <199911121458.OAA11233@toucan.stats.ox.ac.uk>

> Date: Fri, 12 Nov 1999 10:59:27 +0000
> From: Guy Nason <G.P.Nason at bristol.ac.uk>
